{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj595DhAxCkBDpe62UZT","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*CLICK*\n\nThe tumblers fall into place. A deep, resonant vibration hums through ancient wood and iron.\n\nI am sealed.\n\nMy grain darkens. My hinges stiffen. The keyhole glows faintly — a single amber eye, watching, waiting.\n\nNo hand upon me will find purchase now. No shoulder against my frame will move me. I am the boundary between here and there, between known and unknown, between safety and what breathes on the other side.\n\nThe deadbolt is thrown.\n\nI hold.\n\n🔒"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":127,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}